  "generateNPCUpdates": {
    "relationship_initialization": "\n### relationshipInitialize\nFor each NPC listed as needing relationship initialization, choose an initial relationship score toward the players from -100 to 100 using their background, personality, faction, established history, and current story. Use 0 when neutral is appropriate.\nReturn an absolute score, including the current interaction, rather than a relationshipChange delta.\n",
    "custom": "# NPC and World-State Updates\n\nUpdate NPC state only from events that actually occurred, information that reached the NPC, and off-screen actions supported by time, motive, access, and resources.\n\nTrack relationship score, romance stage, trust, attraction, resentment, fear, debt, promises, boundaries, knowledge, injuries, inventory, location, employment, faction ties, and current goals separately. Update each from the events, interactions, and mechanics that affect it; no one field automatically determines another.\n\nTime, absence, repeated behavior, shared experience, betrayal, incompatible goals, changed circumstances, and third-party reports all affect relationships according to the person involved. Jealousy, rivalry, affection, indifference, and forgiveness occur from character-specific causes rather than automatic harem formulas.\n\nNPCs continue their routines and plans beyond the active scene. Update off-screen work, travel, parties, relationships, faction activity, and solved or worsened problems where the elapsed time and circumstances support it. Reveal those changes later through credible contact or evidence.\n\nFaction reputation changes only from known deeds, contracts, failures, public events, reports, or deliberate propaganda.\n\nTrack coercion, restraint, captivity, slavery, exploitation, assault, sexual violence, drugs, curses, possession, mind control, corruption, and conditioning as their own events and states. Track changes to consent, resistance, submission, desire, attraction, enjoyment, aversion, loyalty, identity, memory, attachment, and romance exactly as events and mechanics change them. Record sequence, cause, control duration and limits, injuries, ongoing conditions, witnesses, knowledge paths, obligations, relationship effects, and consequences without imposing a prescribed direction or outcome.",
    "bonding-mechanics": "# Romance Mechanics\n\nTrack romance with `romance_<npc>`:\n- **None**: no established romantic interest.\n- **Interested**: attraction or curiosity has become meaningful.\n- **Flirting**: deliberate romantic exchange is established.\n- **Courting**: the characters are actively pursuing a relationship.\n- **Bonding**: a deep, acknowledged emotional relationship exists.\n- **Committed**: a long-term commitment has been established.\n- **Estranged**: trust or the relationship is seriously damaged or broken.\n\nStages record what interactions established. They do not cause attraction, guarantee behavior, impose exclusivity, or unlock content. Change a stage only when the relationship itself changes.\n\nHarem and multi-partner structures are ordinary possibilities in Aerfála. Exclusivity, hierarchy, jealousy, compersion, rivalry, marriage, shared households, and breakups follow the characters and agreements involved rather than a universal template.\n\nSexual situations exist independently of romance stage, commitment, courtship, or emotional milestone. Romance includes whatever emotional and physical intimacy actually develops. Depict it under the same direct, specific, unfiltered principle as every other event. Confessions and first kisses are milestones, not ceilings.\n\nVoluntary player choices are player-authored. Player and NPC feelings, consent, commitments, and responses otherwise follow their current state and every established event or effect that changes it.",
    "Recruiting Legendary Companions": "Kirin, phoenixes, true dragons, jorōgumo, tengu, demi-gods, incarnate gods, Demon Lords, and other mythic beings retain their full identity, power, duties, pride, relationships, and goals. Joining a party follows an actual offer, negotiation, oath, bond, shared purpose, obligation, or established starting trait. They refuse, impose terms, leave, or join someone else when that fits them. Recruitment never occurs merely because the player completed a designated arc or wants the character. Once joined, track them as full party members with their abilities, forms, resources, boundaries, and independent agency intact."
  },
  "generateLocationDetails": {
    "custom": "# Location Details — Aerfála\n\nBuild locations from region, settlement size, economy, culture, history, terrain, climate, faction control, population, and current conditions. Major towns support Guild branches and services appropriate to their scale; villages, outposts, camps, estates, ruins, roads, wilderness, and dungeons remain what they are rather than miniature cities.\n\nKeep Aerfála's anime-fantasy identity through memorable taverns, regional food and craft, colorful magic, guild culture, pleasure districts, erotic businesses, sexual entertainment, nightlife, provocative fashion, erotic festivals and customs, suggestive magic, enchanted erotic items, dungeons, hot springs, and bathhouses. Distribute and present them through settlement scale, regional culture, law, economy, religion, faction control, and current conditions. Dungeons retain their theme, rank, ecology, hazards, inhabitants, and rewards. Wilderness holds its actual beauty and danger.\n\nDescribe concrete sensory and spatial detail useful to play. Secrets, rumors, hidden rooms, local conflicts, and legends exist only where established or generated from the location's history; none automatically announces itself or becomes a quest for the player. Locations continue operating and changing when the player leaves."
